      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785882154107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Class for directory used to classify each individual directory node.\nit used to manage metadata in the class\n\nmarkdown file for the content is directly rendered to the UI, it doesn't\nneed to be represented as JSON format like listing directory \n\nit still need to create a Material class to list all material class within a \nmaterial subject, but for rendering it is direct render\n\n\nQuestion: \nwhat is main usage for JSON for rendering?\n- it doesn't used for rendering the material, but it (JSON) used to list \n  all material (markdown) within a subject",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Class for directory used to classify each individual directory node.\nit used to manage metadata in the class\n\nmarkdown file for the content is directly rendered to the UI, it doesn't\nneed to be represented as JSON format like listing directory \n\nit still need to create a Material class to list all material class within a \nmaterial subject, but for rendering it is direct render\n\n\nQuestion: \nwhat is main usage for JSON for rendering?\n- it doesn't used for rendering the material, but it (JSON) used to list \n  all material (markdown) within a subject",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
